---
title: "exitMarket (Compound V2: Comptroller)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_listed: market = markets[cToken]
    q_check_listed --> q_not_entered: !market.accountMembership[msg.sender]
    q_not_entered --> [*]: return NO_ERROR (idempotent, not an error)
    q_check_listed --> q_borrow_check: market.accountMembership[msg.sender] == true
    q_borrow_check --> q_has_borrow: borrowBalance = cToken.borrowBalanceStored(msg.sender) > 0
    q_has_borrow --> [*]: return EXIT_MARKET_BALANCE_OWED
    q_borrow_check --> q_liquidity: borrowBalance == 0
    q_liquidity --> q_shortfall: getHypotheticalAccountLiquidity shows shortfall after exit
    q_shortfall --> [*]: return EXIT_MARKET_REJECTION (insufficient liquidity)
    q_liquidity --> q_remove: no shortfall after exit
    q_remove --> q_cleanup: market.accountMembership[msg.sender] = false
    q_cleanup --> [*]: remove cToken from accountAssets[msg.sender]; emit MarketExited; return NO_ERROR

    note right of q_borrow_check
        INV-001: Cannot exit market with outstanding borrow balance
        INV-002: Exiting market not currently entered is not an error
    end note

    note right of q_liquidity
        INV-003: Hypothetical liquidity must remain positive after removing collateral
        INV-004: Exited markets no longer count toward collateral calculations
    end note
